{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 03 — Ajuste do Modelo MMM com Erro-Padrão HAC\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objetivo:** ajustar a regressão OLS com correção HAC (Newey-West) e interpretar os resultados.\n",
    "\n",
    "Roteiro:\n",
    "1. Carregar dados e fazer split treino / holdout\n",
    "2. Ajustar o modelo\n",
    "3. Inspecionar coeficientes, p-valores e IC 95% (HAC)\n",
    "4. Diagnóstico: Durbin-Watson, VIF, resíduos\n",
    "5. Decomposição de contribuições por canal\n",
    "6. CPA implícito vs. CPA de planejamento\n",
    "7. Gráfico de significância por canal"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys, os\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, os.path.abspath(\"..\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import matplotlib.ticker as mticker\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "from statsmodels.stats.stattools import durbin_watson as dw_stat\n",
    "\n",
    "from src.model import MMMModel, DEFAULT_CHANNEL_PARAMS\n",
    "from src.validation import temporal_split, compute_metrics\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\", palette=\"muted\", font_scale=1.1)\n",
    "plt.rcParams[\"figure.dpi\"] = 110\n",
    "print(\"Módulos carregados.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Carregar Dados e Split"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df = pd.read_csv(\"../data/MMM_Synth_Weekly_Data.csv\", parse_dates=[\"week\"])\n",
    "df = df.sort_values(\"week\").reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "df_train, df_holdout = temporal_split(df, holdout_weeks=24)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Treino  : {len(df_train)} semanas  \"\n",
    "      f\"({df_train['week'].min().date()} → {df_train['week'].max().date()})\")\n",
    "print(f\"Holdout : {len(df_holdout)} semanas  \"\n",
    "      f\"({df_holdout['week'].min().date()} → {df_holdout['week'].max().date()})\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Ajustar o Modelo"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "mmm = MMMModel(channel_params=DEFAULT_CHANNEL_PARAMS, hac_lags=4)\n",
    "mmm.fit(df_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Métricas in-sample\n",
    "m = mmm.metrics()\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 50)\n",
    "print(\"MÉTRICAS — PERÍODO DE TREINO\")\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 50)\n",
    "print(f\"  R²           : {m['R2']:.4f}  ({m['R2']*100:.1f}%)\")\n",
    "print(f\"  R² ajustado  : {m['R2_adj']:.4f}  ({m['R2_adj']*100:.1f}%)\")\n",
    "print(f\"  MAPE         : {m['MAPE_%']:.2f}%\")\n",
    "print(f\"  RMSE         : {m['RMSE']:,.0f} assinantes/semana\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Sumário completo do statsmodels\n",
    "print(mmm.summary())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Coeficientes, IC 95% e p-valores (HAC)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Por que HAC?**  \n",
    "Séries temporais de marketing apresentam autocorrelação residual — o erro-padrão OLS clássico subestima essa correlação e infla a significância estatística. O estimador HAC (Newey-West) produz erros-padrão robustos a autocorrelação e heterocedasticidade."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "coef_df = mmm.coef_table()\n",
    "coef_df[\"significativo (5%)\"] = coef_df[\"p_value\"] < 0.05\n",
    "\n",
    "with pd.option_context(\"display.float_format\", \"{:.4f}\".format):\n",
    "    display(coef_df)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Gráfico de coeficientes com IC 95%\n",
    "media_coef = coef_df[coef_df[\"feature\"].str.startswith(\"media_\")].copy()\n",
    "media_coef[\"canal\"] = (\n",
    "    media_coef[\"feature\"]\n",
    "    .str.replace(\"media_\", \"\")\n",
    "    .str.replace(\"_\", \" \")\n",
    "    .str.title()\n",
    ")\n",
    "media_coef = media_coef.sort_values(\"coef\", ascending=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "colors = [\"#2ecc71\" if p < 0.05 else \"#e74c3c\" for p in media_coef[\"p_value\"]]\n",
    "ax.barh(media_coef[\"canal\"], media_coef[\"coef\"], color=colors, alpha=0.8)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Barras de erro\n",
    "ax.errorbar(\n",
    "    media_coef[\"coef\"],\n",
    "    media_coef[\"canal\"],\n",
    "    xerr=[\n",
    "        media_coef[\"coef\"] - media_coef[\"ci_lower\"],\n",
    "        media_coef[\"ci_upper\"] - media_coef[\"coef\"]\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    fmt=\"none\", color=\"#2c3e50\", capsize=5, lw=1.5, capthick=1.5\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.axvline(0, color=\"gray\", lw=0.8, linestyle=\"--\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Coeficiente (assinantes por unidade de saturação)\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Coeficientes do MMM com IC 95% (HAC)\\n\"\n",
    "             \"Verde = significativo (p<0.05) | Vermelho = não significativo\",\n",
    "             fontweight=\"bold\")\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis=\"x\")\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"../outputs/channel_significance.png\", dpi=130, bbox_inches=\"tight\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Diagnóstico: Durbin-Watson e VIF"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Durbin-Watson\n",
    "residuals = mmm.result_.resid\n",
    "dw_val    = dw_stat(residuals)\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 50)\n",
    "print(\"DIAGNÓSTICO DE AUTOCORRELAÇÃO\")\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 50)\n",
    "print(f\"  Durbin-Watson : {dw_val:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  Interpretação : \", end=\"\")\n",
    "if dw_val < 1.5:\n",
    "    print(\"Autocorrelação POSITIVA detectada → HAC é necessário ✓\")\n",
    "elif dw_val > 2.5:\n",
    "    print(\"Autocorrelação NEGATIVA detectada\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"Sem autocorrelação significativa\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# VIF\n",
    "vif_df = mmm.vif()\n",
    "print(\"\\nVIF — Diagnóstico de Multicolinearidade\")\n",
    "print(\"  (VIF < 5 = baixa | 5-10 = moderada | > 10 = alta)\")\n",
    "print(vif_df.to_string(index=False))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Gráfico de resíduos\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Resíduos ao longo do tempo\n",
    "axes[0].plot(df_train[\"week\"], residuals, color=\"#0f3460\", lw=1.0)\n",
    "axes[0].axhline(0, color=\"gray\", lw=0.8, linestyle=\"--\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Resíduos ao Longo do Tempo\", fontweight=\"bold\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_ylabel(\"Resíduo (assinantes)\")\n",
    "axes[0].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Distribuição dos resíduos\n",
    "axes[1].hist(residuals, bins=25, color=\"#16213e\", alpha=0.7, edgecolor=\"white\")\n",
    "axes[1].axvline(0, color=\"#e94560\", lw=1.5, linestyle=\"--\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Distribuição dos Resíduos\", fontweight=\"bold\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"Resíduo\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_ylabel(\"Frequência\")\n",
    "axes[1].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Decomposição de Contribuições por Canal"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "decomp = mmm.decompose(df_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Empilhar para gráfico de área\n",
    "contrib_cols = [c for c in decomp.columns if c.startswith(\"contrib_\")]\n",
    "stack_data   = decomp[contrib_cols + [\"baseline\"]]\n",
    "channel_labels = [\n",
    "    c.replace(\"contrib_\", \"\").replace(\"_\", \" \").title()\n",
    "    for c in stack_data.columns\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(14, 6))\n",
    "colors  = sns.color_palette(\"tab10\", len(stack_data.columns))\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.stackplot(\n",
    "    df_train[\"week\"],\n",
    "    stack_data.T.values,\n",
    "    labels=channel_labels,\n",
    "    colors=colors,\n",
    "    alpha=0.85,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Observado\n",
    "ax.plot(df_train[\"week\"], df_train[\"new_subscribers\"],\n",
    "        color=\"black\", lw=1.5, linestyle=\"--\", label=\"Observado\", zorder=5)\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Decomposição de Contribuições por Canal — Período de Treino\",\n",
    "             fontweight=\"bold\")\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Novos Assinantes\")\n",
    "ax.yaxis.set_major_formatter(mticker.FuncFormatter(lambda x, _: f\"{x:,.0f}\"))\n",
    "ax.legend(loc=\"upper left\", fontsize=8, ncol=2)\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.2)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Tabela de contribuição total\n",
    "contrib_total = decomp[contrib_cols + [\"baseline\"]].sum().sort_values(ascending=False)\n",
    "total         = contrib_total.sum()\n",
    "print(\"\\nContribuição Total — Período de Treino\")\n",
    "for col, val in contrib_total.items():\n",
    "    label = col.replace(\"contrib_\", \"\").replace(\"_\", \" \").title()\n",
    "    print(f\"  {label:40s} {val:>10,.0f} subs ({val/total*100:.1f}%)\")\n",
    "print(f\"  {'TOTAL':40s} {total:>10,.0f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. CPA Implícito (MMM) vs. CPA de Planejamento"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "cpa_df = mmm.cpa_implied(df_train)\n",
    "print(cpa_df.to_string(index=False))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "x     = np.arange(len(cpa_df))\n",
    "width = 0.35\n",
    "\n",
    "bars1 = ax.bar(x - width/2, cpa_df[\"CPA_implicito_R$\"],\n",
    "               width, label=\"CPA Implícito (MMM)\",  color=\"#0f3460\", alpha=0.85)\n",
    "bars2 = ax.bar(x + width/2, cpa_df[\"CPA_target_R$\"],\n",
    "               width, label=\"CPA Target (Planejamento)\", color=\"#e94560\", alpha=0.65)\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.set_xticks(x)\n",
    "ax.set_xticklabels(cpa_df[\"canal\"], rotation=30, ha=\"right\", fontsize=9)\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"CPA (R$)\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"CPA Implícito (MMM) vs. CPA de Planejamento por Canal\", fontweight=\"bold\")\n",
    "ax.legend()\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis=\"y\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Ratio annotation\n",
    "for bar1, bar2, ratio in zip(bars1, bars2, cpa_df[\"ratio_imp_vs_target\"]):\n",
    "    color = \"#2ecc71\" if ratio < 1 else \"#e74c3c\"\n",
    "    ax.text(\n",
    "        bar1.get_x() + bar1.get_width() / 2,\n",
    "        max(bar1.get_height(), bar2.get_height()) + 1,\n",
    "        f\"{ratio:.2f}x\", ha=\"center\", fontsize=8, color=color, fontweight=\"bold\"\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"../outputs/cpa_implied_vs_assumed.png\", dpi=130, bbox_inches=\"tight\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Ajustado vs. Observado — Treino"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fitted = mmm.result_.fittedvalues\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(14, 4))\n",
    "ax.plot(df_train[\"week\"], df_train[\"new_subscribers\"],\n",
    "        color=\"#1a1a2e\", lw=1.5, label=\"Observado\")\n",
    "ax.plot(df_train[\"week\"], fitted,\n",
    "        color=\"#e94560\", lw=1.3, linestyle=\"--\", label=\"Ajustado (MMM)\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Ajuste In-Sample — Observado vs. MMM\", fontweight=\"bold\")\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Novos Assinantes\")\n",
    "ax.yaxis.set_major_formatter(mticker.FuncFormatter(lambda x, _: f\"{x:,.0f}\"))\n",
    "ax.legend()\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n➡ Próximo notebook: 04_holdout_validation.ipynb — Validação Out-of-Sample\")"
   ]
  }
 ],
